{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02904","headline":"奉和别鲁王 · 杨思玄","name":"奉和别鲁王","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"元王诗传博，文后宠灵优。\n鹤盖动宸眷，龙章送远游。\n函关疏别道，灞岸引行舟。\n北林分苑树，东流溢御沟。\n鸟声含羽碎，骑影曳花浮。\n圣泽九垓普，天文七曜周。\n方图献雅乐，簪带奉鸣球。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨思玄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02904.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02904","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}